      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "YOTTIE (5) has been dominant in winning his two outings since a spell, drawing very wide but working to the front in a heat of this series here last week and cruising home by close to 11m. The previous time he raced at this circuit he placed in the NSW Derby. He is two from three when third-up and looks the one to beat. ALERT BAY (8) chased boom colt Loucasso for three straight seconds before landing a well-deserved win at this circuit and distance last start, working to the front from a similar draw to this before scoring by 7m. He could do that again. ENJABONARLO (2) has been racing well from wider barriers, recording a win in a heat of this series at Bathurst along with two placings at this circuit and distance from his last three outings. Draws to play a role again as does ETHANS REVENGE (1) who has some decent form behind him including a win here three back and he should enjoy a soft run.",
